# Implementation Plan — FinanceFlow AI (Agentic Financial Operations Platform)

FinanceFlow AI is an Agentic AI-powered financial operations platform built with React, Node.js + Express, MySQL, and Groq API. It automates payment reconciliation, repayment risk assessment, collection follow-ups, document intelligence, and financial analytics through controlled backend tool calling and a strict **Human-in-the-Loop** architecture.

