## 3. End-to-End Payment Lifecycle & Human-in-the-Loop Gate

```
                  Payment API Trigger (POST /api/payments/ingest)
                                        │
                                        ▼
                  1. Ingest original payment into payments table
                         (status: "unmatched", source: "api")
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 2. Duplicate Check (transaction_reference & pattern)
                      ├── Duplicate Found ➔ Flag / Mark Rejected
                      └── Unique Payment ➔ Proceed
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 3. Create reconciliation_cases Record (status: "pending")
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 4. Payment Reconciliation AI Agent Execution (Groq Tool Calling)
                      ├── searchCompany(senderName, senderAccount)
                      ├── getActiveLoans(companyId)
                      ├── getDueRepayments(loanId)
                      ├── getPaymentHistory(companyId)
                      └── checkDuplicateTransactions(txnRef, sender, amount)
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 5. AI Writes Candidate to ai_recommendations Table
                      ├── recommended_company_id, recommended_loan_id, recommended_repayment_id
                      ├── confidence_score (e.g. 96%)
                      ├── reasoning_summary
                      └── status: "pending"
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 6. Human Verification (React Accountant Dashboard)
                                        │
             ┌──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┐
             ▼                          ▼                          ▼
        [ REJECT ]                 [ PENDING ]                [ APPROVE ]
             │                          │                          │
             ▼                          ▼                          ▼
   - ai_rec.status='rejected'    - case.status='under_review' - Backend ACID Transaction:
   - case.status='rejected'      - Kept open for manual        * Insert payment_allocations
   - payments.status='rejected'    investigation               * Update repayment_schedules (amount_paid/pending/status)
   - Reason logged in audit_logs                               * Update payments (status='fully_allocated' / 'partially_allocated')
                                                               * case.status='resolved'
                                                               * ai_rec.status='approved'
                                                               * Detailed entry in audit_logs
```

