## 4. Mandatory Audit & Overrides Specification

| Action | Audit Trail & Ledger Rules |
|---|---|
| **AI Candidate Generation** | System logs candidate creation in `ai_recommendations`. Financial ledger is **untouched**. |
| **Human Approval** | Creates `payment_allocations` row (`approved_by = req.user.id`), updates `repayment_schedules`, updates `payments` status, sets `reconciliation_cases.status = 'resolved'`. Writes action `APPROVE_ALLOCATION` to `audit_logs`. |
| **Human Rejection** | Sets `ai_recommendations.status = 'rejected'`, sets `reconciliation_cases.status = 'rejected'`. Rejection reason is recorded in `audit_logs`. |
| **Pending Investigation** | Sets `reconciliation_cases.status = 'under_review'`. Open for manual search and investigation in Accountant Dashboard. |
| **Accountant Override** | Requires a mandatory `override_reason` text string. Backend writes `{ old_ai_recommendation, manual_allocation, override_reason }` to `audit_logs` under action `OVERRIDE_RECONCILIATION`. |

